# The road to the camp (docs/ROADMAP.md slice 2, step 1), through the real keys:
# Maren has given her lead and the pick has found iron, so the goal is the crew
# who pay for it and the survey marks their camp; Rook there says he was paid,
# and keeps the note to himself (its hand is the Echo's, slice 4).
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/road-to-camp.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 --beats=marens_lead --give=pick:1,iron_ore:1
#
# `at cast:rook` asks 49_cast where he stands; nothing here is a coordinate.
coast calm
wait 1.0
shot 01-the-iron-goes-to-the-crew with beat:marens_lead

press map 0.2
await app:map 6
wait 0.6
shot 02-the-survey-marks-the-camp with app:map
press map 0.2
await app:none 5

at cast:rook
await cast:rook 8
wait 0.6
press use
await talking 3
wait 0.4
shot 03-rook-was-paid-to-wait with talking,cast:rook
press use
await beat:crew_paid 3
wait 0.4
shot 04-and-keeps-the-note with talking,beat:crew_paid
press pause
wait 0.5
await met:rook 2
wait 0.6
shot 05-the-crew-met with met:rook
